      <li>The license may not be resold, shared, or redistributed.</li>
      <li>Minor updates are included; a future major version may be a separate, discounted purchase for existing customers.</li>
      <li>The software is provided "as is", without warranty. LinerFM is not affiliated with Spotify.</li>
      <li>Purchases are final given the free trial, save for genuine edge cases handled at our discretion.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-8 text-xs text-white/40">Last updated: 2026-06-13.</p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
